# GA4 measurement ID (e.g. G-ABC123XYZ), or a Google tag ID (GT-ABC123XYZ) — both are accepted.
#
# Set it in Cloudflare Pages → Settings → Environment variables to override the built-in default
# (G-N0XRLVLWXB = the pip24h.com web stream inside property "PIP24H → Buy Smart Reviews").
# Leave it empty to use that default. Note the env var WINS over the default, so if you ever set it
# to another stream's ID here, that stream is what production reports to.
PUBLIC_GA_ID=
